  (text "MONO 56 V INDEPENDENT OV INPUT\nR93 senses DCBUS directly; R94 returns to GND.\nU13 = REF35125QDBVR, 1.25 V, powered from VCC.\nU12 = TLV3201AIDBVR; C211 filters OV_SENSE.\nIdeal external-network trip/release: 60.01 / 55.03 V.\nADC divider remains 22:1; firmware port required.\nTolerance, startup, transient and brake qualification remain open."
