  (text "BRAKE PERMISSION / MOTOR INHIBIT\nBRK_OK LOW clears the motor arm latch through U59/U57.\nRecovery requires a fresh DRV_EN_MCU rising edge.\nPC7 reads BRK_OK_FB through R213; configure input/no-pull.\nPermission does not prove resistor continuity or energy capacity."
    (at 279.4 124.46 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "e81786ed-3760-4020-ab36-b44016075329")
  )
  (text "MONO ENABLE INTERLOCK\nOV / rail-good loss / brake permission loss / reset clears U56.\nRecovery requires a NEW rising PB12 request.\nU15 also disables immediately when PB12 is low.\nPC6 reads DRV_ENABLE; PC7 reads BRK_OK; firmware port required."
    (at 33.02 190.5 0)
    (effects (font (size 1.27 1.27)) (justify left top))
    (uuid "340f95ab-46e1-4bb4-a1b8-81b8748fed8a")
  )
